WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Prepare done-check.yaml in the CSV project: two automated tests and one manual check.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Preview the three checks and their commands. No tests run during this preview.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Review and confirm the checklist. Only the user can confirm it or submit a manual verdict.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Run the checks. The CSV escaping test fails, and its original report is shown.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Inspect check 2: the original error, executed command and exit code 1 are preserved.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Ask the agent to fix escaping, then re-run. Both automated checks pass; the manual item waits.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Verify the Chinese filename yourself, then record ok. All three agreed checks now pass.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:02.000
After a source edit, all three old results are stale. Their previous run records remain visible.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Re-run against the current code. The manual item still needs your fresh verification.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Install the plugin using the README, then use these commands in your DSH chat.
